[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Do You Speak English?]
[00:01.04]Did the young man speak English? | 那个年轻人会说英语吗？
[00:14.25]I had an amusing experience last year. | 去年我有一个有趣的经历。
[00:18.79]After I had left a small village in the south of France, | 在我离开法国南部的一个小村庄后，
[00:23.25]I drove on to the next town. | 我驱车前往下一个城镇。
[00:26.26]On the way, a young man waved to me. | 在路上，一个年轻人向我招手。
[00:30.34]I stopped and he asked me for a lift. | 我停了下来，他请求我搭他一程。
[00:34.12]As soon as he had got into the car, | 他一上车，
[00:37.62]I said good morning to him in French and he replied in the same language. | 我就用法语向他问好，他也用同样的语言回答我。
[00:43.84]Apart from a few words, | 除了一些词语，
[00:46.38]I do not know any French at all. | 我一点法语也不会。
[00:49.77]Neither of us spoke during the journey. | 在旅途中，我们两人都没有说话。
[00:52.90]I had nearly reached the town, when the young man suddenly said, very slowly, | 我快到城镇时，那个年轻人突然非常缓慢地说，
[01:00.00]'Do you speak English?' | “你会说英语吗？”
[01:04.10]As I soon learnt, he was English himself! | 我很快了解到，他自己就是英国人！